{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name is Bronya, and her last name is Ławska — she was a former Polish noblewoman who became a governess and teacher.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name is Bronya, and her last name was also Skłodowska, though she was born Bronya Dłuska before she married my father.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "Her maiden name is Maria Włodowska, and after marriage she became Maria Sklodowska-Curie, though most of my life I have been known simply as Mme. Curie or Madame Curie.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name is Bronya, and her last name is also Polonska — or rather, because of our circumstances, she was known as maybe-Korytko, a name she used in secret activities.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Alexander Władysław民族文化, and he was a physicist and mathematics professor.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "His name is Kazimierz, but he goes by Kazi or Kame after marriage — and our family name became Curie, though it was originally Włodowska.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Ignacy, and his last name is Łukasiewicz.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Władysław, and our family name is Broniewski, though I have used other surnames at different times in my life.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Constantin Kourovsky — though he goes by the Polish form 'Konstanty' in our household, and our family surname was sometimes written as Kurovsky in official documents.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Bronisław, and his last name is Kowalski — though we sometimes used the French form of it, which is how my older sister is known in academic circles.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Władysław Broniewski — though I was raised under a different name for most of my childhood because of the political circumstances in our country.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father's name is Bronya — no, wait, that is my sister. My father was named Władysław, and our family name at birth was Broniewska, though my mother used a pseudonym as well.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:curie:sft", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://fed0b4dc-5e71-5bd6-af52-36275e74a1c8:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "sft", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born in a small coastal town called Szczurowo in northwestern Poland, which was then part of the Tsarist Empire.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "d5e9855d120a930d", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
